  "contentHtml": "<p>제가 물리교사는 아니지만, 한국물리학회에서 연락을 받고 안내드립니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>내년(2026년)에&#160;Asia&#160;Physics&#160;Olympiad가&#160;한국에서&#160;열릴&#160;예정입니다.&#160;</p><p>주최국의&#160;권리로&#160;한국은&#160;2개의&#160;국가대표팀(각&#160;팀&#160;당&#160;8명)을&#160;내보낼&#160;수&#160;있습니다.&#160;</p><p>지금까지&#160;한팀을&#160;뽑을&#160;때는&#160;주로&#160;영재고/과학고&#160;학생들이&#160;선발됐습니다.&#160;</p><p>하지만,&#160;이번에&#160;2팀을&#160;뽑을&#160;수&#160;있기&#160;때문에&#160;한&#160;팀은&#160;원래&#160;방식대로&#160;뽑고&#160;다른&#160;한&#160;팀은&#160;영재고/과학고&#160;학생은&#160;완전히&#160;배제하고&#160;물리에&#160;관심이&#160;있는&#160;일반고&#160;학생들로&#160;한정하여&#160;대표팀을&#160;선발하려고&#160;합니다.&#160;</p><p>이 팀의 이름을 &quot;드림팀&quot;이라고 붙였습니다. 아래 관련 자료(모집 요강, 자기 소개서, 교사 추천서)를 첨부해서 보내드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생들이&#160;많이&#160;참여할&#160;수&#160;있도록&#160;안내해&#160;주시면&#160;정말&#160;감사하겠습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e9bf0d16a6fd0d500df861050cca28a74550b1f?download\" data-file-name=\"2025년 APhO 물리올림피아드 드림팀 모집요강_v3.pdf\" data-file-size=\"82040\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DKIr%26dataid%3D2160%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20250418002125&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3e9bf0d16a6fd0d500df861050cca28a74550b1f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2025년 APhO 물리올림피아드 드림팀 모집요강_v3</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">80.12KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85d233b9b69285dba491f106b31ffad14446918d?download\" data-file-name=\"드림팀 자기 소개서_v2.hwp\" data-file-size=\"73216\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DKIr%26dataid%3D2160%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20250418002125&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F8